      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.55,
      "end_seconds": 10.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "you're fine, sit down. So, what brings you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.62,
      "end_seconds": 17.13,
      "duration_seconds": 5.51,
      "text": "mainly I've been passing out once last week that's why I came"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.23,
      "end_seconds": 24.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "I'll take a few measurements first."
