    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.64,
      "end_seconds": 225.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "I work on a farm, it's quite physical."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.41,
      "end_seconds": 242.38,
      "duration_seconds": 15.97,
      "text": "let me tell you where I've got to. I think we're dealing with a simple faint, probably reflex-related at this stage. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.47,
      "end_seconds": 246.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Is it something serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.38,
      "end_seconds": 265.61,
      "duration_seconds": 18.23,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a simple faint, probably reflex-related do well once it's treated properly so, to recap quickly you've been passing out once last week for three days, severe, and no tongue biting or palpitations"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 266.24,
      "end_seconds": 267.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "yes, that's right"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.56,
      "end_seconds": 304.6,
      "duration_seconds": 22.04,
      "text": "An ECG is what I'd like next for syncope drink enough water and avoid standing still for long stretches and sit if you feel it coming come back after the results are back can you run through the plan with me quickly just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.69,
      "end_seconds": 312.79,
      "duration_seconds": 6.1,
      "text": "so I come back after the results are back is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.48,
      "end_seconds": 319.9,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Okay, I think we're finished. Is everything clear?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.68,
      "end_seconds": 323.15,
